{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":487537,"name":"никита смолен","username":"smolen2011","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/s/d26b3c/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:05:57.469Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-487537-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-487537-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-487537-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-487537-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot shows Can’t reach your computer. Bots and chats cannot load. A previous Reset failed with partial state.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOfficial ticket T-F58206. Sam (AI support) asked for Privacy Mode plus one Reset, then said a teammate would follow up for backend recreate. About 48 hours later there is still no human follow-up and the computer is still unreachable.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-487537-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-487537-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWindows 10 19045, Grok Bot 0.43.0 Stable.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComputer already unreachable after an earlier failed Reset (partial state).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSettings (Ctrl+Shift+J) has only General, Computer, Updates. No Privacy Mode control (not Legacy).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSettings then Updates then Reset Grok Bot Computer, once. Result: Reset failed. The reset could not finish. Grok Bot computer may be in a partial state.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDid NOT click Retry Reset.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSign out/in, Recover, Update Agent Computer, and network checks already done earlier. Test hosts on cursorvm return HTTP 404 from awselb. No change.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-487537-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-487537-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAfter the ticket was escalated for backend recreate, the existing Agent Computer should be repaired/reprovisioned so the app can connect again. Client-side Reset should not leave the computer stuck in partial state.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-487537-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-487537-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWindows 10/11\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-487537-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-487537-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot 0.43.0 Stable (Windows 10 build 19045)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-487537-additional-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-487537-additional-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTicket T-F58206. Sam on 2026-09-07 21:06 UTC+3 said a teammate would follow up. Email follow-ups on 2026-09-08 and 2026-09-09, no human reply.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCursor user ID: auth0 user_01KYCXH2GZ53VR82JNFB6CW360\u003cbr\u003e\nGrok Bot account slot: 1d21a825ed1884ec3ea86ea73272646495a166a4a13f1a4f388bcd6a4c137f19\u003cbr\u003e\nConversation ID: not available. Left sidebar has no agents, only the unreachable error.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease ping Colin or deanrie for a backend recreate. Same class as other partial-state VM tickets. Do not ask me to Reset again.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRelated forum topics: 170373 and 170006.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-487537-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-487537-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-09T16:06:09.403Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":7,"reads":6,"readers_count":5,"score":36.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":171177,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-0-43-0-windows-reset-failed-partial-state-still-unreachable-ticket-t-f58206-waiting-for-backend-recreate","display_username":"никита смолен","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":137038,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-0-43-0-windows-reset-failed-partial-state-still-unreachable-ticket-t-f58206-waiting-for-backend-recreate/171177/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":487556,"name":"Kevin Neilson","username":"kevinn","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/kevinn/{size}/101206_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:29:10.193Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/smolen2011\"\u003e@smolen2011\u003c/a\u003e Thank you for the post.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCursor isn’t offered in every region. Availability of the Service is governed by our Terms of Service (\u003c